    "id": "LVMC-11-30-030",
    "title": "Passing vehicle stopped at crosswalk",
    "text": "Whenever any vehicle is stopped at a marked crosswalk or at any unmarked crosswalk at an intersection to permit a pedestrian to cross the roadway, the driver of any other vehicle approaching from the rear shall not overtake and pass such stopped vehicle.",
